Package: omen-linux
Architecture: @ARCH@
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: omen-linux contributors <noreply@example.invalid>
Depends: @SHLIBS@, libadwaita-1-0 (>= 1.4), polkitd, systemd, init-system-helpers
Recommends: power-profiles-daemon
Description: Native Linux system monitoring for HP OMEN and Victus
 Rust and GTK4 monitoring application with CPU/GPU, fan and battery
 measurements, history graphs, a CLI and diagnostics. No account or telemetry.
 .
 Development snapshot: hardware writes are off by default. A separately
 managed exact-target writer supports an explicitly approved, bounded
 Automatic/Maximum trial. Sustained fan control, RGB and charge writes
 remain unreleased. Standard power profiles require explicit opt-in.
 Mock adapters are identified as fixture data.
